    "description": "<p>You draw a circle up to a 10-foot diameter circle on the ground inscribed with shinobi sigils that link your location to another location, in which you previously cast this jutsu. You must have cast this jutsu, previously marking the space on the ground where the teleportation effect sends creatures affected by this jutsu.</p>\n<p>Only you or a trigger you set can trigger this sealing circle. Once activated all creatures in the circle are immediately teleported to the exact location within 10 feet of its exact coordinates.</p>",
